# Tasks Widget — 5 Design Suggestions

Five distinct treatments for the dashboard **Tasks** widget. Each shows the same data
(title, status, priority, assignee, due date, labels) arranged for a different job-to-be-done.

---

## 1. Grouped Checklist  ·  *"clear my buckets"*

Status buckets stacked vertically, checkbox rows, inline due/assignee. Best for a personal
to-do flow where you tick things off top-to-bottom.

```
┌─ Tasks ──────────────────────────────────── ⚙ ─┐
│                                                 │
│  OVERDUE (2)                                    │
│  ☐ ●  Ship billing fix          @kalle  Jun 12  │
│  ☐ ●  Reply to vendor email     @mia    Jun 14  │
│                                                 │
│  TODAY (3)                                      │
│  ☐ ◐  Draft Q3 roadmap          @kalle  ·today· │
│  ☐ ○  Review PR #482            @sam    ·today· │
│  ☑ ─  Standup notes             @kalle  ✓done   │
│                                                 │
│  UPCOMING (4)                            ▾ show │
│  ☐ ○  Design review             @mia    Jun 18  │
│  ☐ ○  Onboarding deck           @sam    Jun 20  │
│                                                 │
│  + Add task                          5 of 9 ▸   │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
   ● high   ◐ med   ○ low      ☐ open  ☑ done
```

