## 3. Priority Agenda  ·  *"what matters most"*

Flat list sorted by priority, due date right-aligned, overdue flagged red. Best for a single
"do these in order" column. Priority flag is the dominant visual.

```
┌─ Tasks · by priority ───────────────────────── ⚙ ─┐
│                                                    │
│  ⚑ HIGH                                            │
│  ▸ Ship billing fix              @kalle  ⚠ Jun 12  │
│  ▸ Reply to vendor email         @mia    ⚠ Jun 14  │
│                                                    │
│  ⚐ MEDIUM                                          │
│  ▸ Draft Q3 roadmap              @kalle    today   │
│  ▸ Design review                 @mia      Jun 18  │
│                                                    │
│  · LOW                                             │
│  ▸ Review PR #482                @sam      today   │
│  ▸ Onboarding deck               @sam      Jun 20  │
│                                                    │
│  ────────────────────────────────────────────     │
│  ⚠ 2 overdue · 3 due today              ▸ open all │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

