## 4. Compact Table  ·  *"dense & scannable"*

Tabular, one row per task, sortable column headers. Best for power users / large task counts
where density beats whitespace. Status shown as a pill.

```
┌─ Tasks ─────────────────────────────────────────────── ⚙ ─┐
│  TASK                  ASSIGNEE   DUE      PRI   STATUS    │
│ ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │
│  Ship billing fix      @kalle     Jun 12   ●●●   [doing]   │
│  Reply to vendor       @mia       Jun 14   ●●●   [todo]    │
│  Draft Q3 roadmap      @kalle     today    ●●    [doing]   │
│  Review PR #482        @sam       today    ●     [todo]    │
│  Design review         @mia       Jun 18   ●     [todo]    │
│  Onboarding deck       @sam       Jun 20   ●     [todo]    │
│  Standup notes         @kalle     —        ·     [done]    │
│ ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │
│  ◀ 1–7 of 23                    filter ▾    sort: PRI ▾    │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

