## 5. Today Focus  ·  *"one thing at a time"*

Hero card: progress ring + the single next task large, queue beneath. Best for a calm,
focus-mode widget that nudges one action. Great as a small square tile.

```
┌─ Tasks · Today ───────────────────────── ⚙ ─┐
│                                              │
│       ╭─────╮                                │
│       │ 40% │   2 of 5 done today            │
│       ╰─────╯   ▰▰▱▱▱                         │
│                                              │
│   NEXT UP                                    │
│   ┌────────────────────────────────────┐    │
│   │ ●  Draft Q3 roadmap                 │    │
│   │    @kalle · due today · ~2h         │    │
│   │                       [ Start ▸ ]   │    │
│   └────────────────────────────────────┘    │
│                                              │
│   THEN                                       │
│   · Review PR #482            @sam   today   │
│   · Reply to vendor email     @mia   Jun 14  │
│                                              │
│   ✓ done: Standup · Deploy v2     ▸ view all │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

---

### Quick comparison

| # | Design          | Layout      | Best for                        | Tile size |
|---|-----------------|-------------|---------------------------------|-----------|
| 1 | Grouped Checklist | vertical list | personal tick-off flow        | tall      |
| 2 | Mini Kanban     | columns     | seeing stage/flow               | wide      |
| 3 | Priority Agenda | sorted list | "do in order" by importance     | tall      |
| 4 | Compact Table   | table       | density, many tasks, sorting    | wide      |
| 5 | Today Focus     | hero card   | calm focus-mode, one next action| square    |
